 {
  "id": 805,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_01",
  "en": "Across many generations, the ice-covered straits of the Gati Archipelago have remained still. Ancient, creaking voices recount tales of a city of Progenitors long lost, dead gods buried far beneath the surface world."
 },
 {
  "id": 806,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_02",
  "en": "At the cusp of each century, it stirs. In the times heralding the Red Star, its glaciers rupture, its ice thaws, and shimmering Ichor once more bellows forth from the husks of the Progenitors, infused with the purpose of its long-dead hosts."
 },
 {
  "id": 807,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_03",
  "en": "At these times, some claim a seductive call summons them to the straits. The silken voices of the Progenitors worm their way across the land, beckoning each to pursue their own ambitions. To seek out the ruins below."
 },
 {
  "id": 808,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_04",
  "en": "In the wake of their siren song, delvers set out in search of riches and fame, scholars venture to regain lost knowledge, and eccentrics consume the shimmering Ichor to gain its creators' favour. Yet, deep beneath the surface, something else stirs, aching to burst forth."
 },
 {
  "id": 809,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_01",
  "en": "An eerie stillness settles across the Gati archipelago. A holy city of devouts and zealots behold the end of their faith; all that came before is swallowed by the silence."
 },
 {
  "id": 810,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_02",
  "en": "In the complete absence of gods, only the raw and violent untapped potential of freed thought remains. A path with no clear destination."
 },
 {
  "id": 811,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_01_new",
  "en": "Across many generations, the ice-covered straits of the Gati Archipelago have remained still. Ancient, creaking voices recount tales of a long-lost city buried far beneath the surface world."
 },
 {
  "id": 812,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_02_new",
  "en": "At the cusp of each century, it stirs. In the times heralding the Red Star, its glaciers rupture, its ice thaws, and shimmering Ichor once more bellows forth from the husks of the Progenitor gods, infused with the purpose of its long-dead hosts."
 },
 {
  "id": 813,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_03_new",
  "en": "At these times, some claim a seductive call summons them to the straits. The silken whispers of the Star worm their way across the land, beckoning each to pursue their own ambitions. To seek out the ruins below."
 },
 {
  "id": 814,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/intro_04_new",
  "en": "In the wake of its siren song, delvers set out in search of riches and fame, scholars venture to regain lost knowledge, and zealots consume the shimmering Ichor to gain its creators' favor. Yet, deep beneath the surface, something else stirs, aching to burst forth."
 },
 {
  "id": 815,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_01_new",
  "en": "And so the Last Emergence was entered into the murals by hands unliving."
 },
 {
  "id": 816,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_02_new",
  "en": "The skies remained dark, and the Red Star shone upon the world no longer."
 },
 {
  "id": 817,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_03_new",
  "en": "An eerie stillness settled across the Gati archipelago, much of the Gray City buried beneath returning to its slumber. "
 },
 {
  "id": 818,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_04_new",
  "en": "Where corruption once roamed, idle hands could now be put to work, and a scarce few began to make their way through the derelict halls."
 },
 {
  "id": 819,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_05_new",
  "en": "The first strike against the crumbling stone reverberated through the spires, ushering in a new age."
 },
 {
  "id": 820,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/outro_06_new",
  "en": "The gods remained silent."
 },
 {
  "id": 821,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker01",
  "en": "Hallowed advent! *hrk* At last, the seal crumbles. At last, you are here. Long have I tended the candleflames, awaiting your arrival."
 },
 {
  "id": 822,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker02",
  "en": "Do not avert your eyes from this hideous shell, for I exist to serve. Our holy mission is at hand. *hrk* The city yet festers, polluted by the unclean."
 },
 {
  "id": 823,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker03",
  "en": "Within the halls of the Court reside those who once wrought our doom. They ultimately sealed themselves within as calamity ensued, many centuries ago."
 },
 {
  "id": 824,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker04",
  "en": "Its gate again lies open, and within stirs an abomination spawned by an old transgression. Once we are rid of it, this city's rebirth may finally commence."
 },
 {
  "id": 825,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker05",
  "en": "I will mark the royal chambers on your map; let it be your guide."
 },
 {
  "id": 826,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_caretaker06",
  "en": "Use this momentary peace to familiarize yourself with your new vessel."
 },
 {
  "id": 827,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_merchant_01",
  "en": "Oh tender stranger, would you spare but a moment for a poor, unfortunate soul?"
 },
 {
  "id": 828,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_merchant_02",
  "en": "Worry not, for I am not like the others, although my burdens remain great."
 },
 {
  "id": 829,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_merchant_04",
  "en": "Weighed down by the corporeal as I am. Cursed some would say, with the compulsion to possess."
 },
 {
  "id": 830,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_merchant_05",
  "en": "I long for nothing more than the blessed Ichor. The very lifeblood of our long-dead gods; equally sacred and profane. I sense it upon you…"
 },
 {
  "id": 831,
  "ctx": "term Dialogue/demo_merchant_06 (+1 more)",
  "en": "Oh tender stranger, would you not see fit to lighten the load of a poor, covetous soul?"
 }
]